sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant Lib as libc
    participant Sys as Syscall boundary
    participant K as Kernel
    participant Drv as Driver
    participant HW as Hardware
    App->>Lib: read(), write(), open()
    Lib->>Sys: trap into the kernel
    Sys->>K: VFS, scheduler, memory manager
    K->>K: is the data already cached?
    alt in the page cache
        K-->>App: served without touching the device
    else must go to the device
        K->>Drv: queue the request
        Drv->>HW: DMA
        HW-->>Drv: completion interrupt
        Drv-->>K: wake the blocked task
        K-->>App: data
    end
    Note over App,HW: every performance question is "which of these layers is the one that is waiting?"
